  "query_preview": "(Thursday through Sunday)...\nDrier inland and not as hot through next weekend. High\ntemperatures will cool a few degrees on Thursday, then slowly warm\nthrough next weekend. High temperatures on Thursday will be as \nmuch as 5 to 10 degrees below average for the mountains and inland\nvalleys, then around 5 degrees below average for those areas for \nnext Sunday.\n\nHigh temperatures on Thursday will range from the 70s near the\ncoast to the mid 80s to around 90 for the Inland Empire with 100 \nto 104 for the lower deserts. For Sunday, high temperatures will \nrange from the 70s near the coast to the upper 80s to mid 90s for \nthe Inland Empire with 104 to 108 for the lower deserts.",
